                                "sense_id": "ecd612d5-c24c-3dc4-9f9b-1abe307fdfd3",
                                "text": "[T]he unfortunate few who suffer from it [ejaculatory anhedonia] are incapable of deriving any pleasure whatsoever from orgasms. They make a bit of mess while staring impassively into the middle distance, and that's it. Like the human equivalent of a pushdown soap-dispenser."
