                                "sense_id": "ecd612d5-c24c-3dc4-9f9b-1abe307fdfd3",
                                "text": "The containers we always use for those are the OXO ones that have the pushdown button, so I think it probably does stay fresher than flour in a paper bag, and in that way, it works."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8ea9d50-6462-4d42-92ab-21ff067b8cf9",
                                "sense_id": "ecd612d5-c24c-3dc4-9f9b-1abe307fdfd3",
                                "text": "This 30ml serum bottle has a pushdown release nozzle applicator."
